# What the scripts never sync to dev-build (lib/common.sh agd_sync). The database holds the
# family's calendars and agendouille.yaml may hold addresses: neither leaves
# the machine it lives on. node_modules is installed on dev-build itself,
# and the worktrees are other checkouts. A leading / anchors a pattern to
# the tree root, so it cannot match a same-named entry deeper.
/.git
/.claude/
/node_modules
/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
/agendouille.yaml
